L000230	As shown in Fig. \ref{fig:ebm}, without loss of generality, an entanglement-based PM QCC protocol for three parties that is equivalent to the prepare-and-measure PM QCC protocol is presented \cite{PRAZhao2020}. There is a virtual qubit at each party
