L000248	\end{equation}
L000249	where  $C^\dagger_i$ is the creation operator of the $i$th virtual source, $\ket{\text{vac}}$ is the vacuum state, $\mu_{AB} = \frac{\mu_A}{2} + \mu_B$ and $\mu_{AC} = \frac{\mu_A}{2} + \mu_C$. The evolution matrix of BS\textsubscript{1} and BS\textsubscript{2} can be expressed as
L000250	\begin{equation} \label{eq:BS}
